{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit\/Equatable-Implementations"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","topicSections":[{"title":"Operators","generated":true,"anchor":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit\/!=(_:_:)"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Equatable Implementations","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcredit\/equatable-implementations"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLCredit":{"title":"MXLCredit","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLCredit"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The credit type represents the appearance of the title, composer, arranger, lyricist, copyright, dedication,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other text, symbols, and graphics that commonly appear on the first page of a score. The credit-words,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credit-symbol, and credit-image elements are similar to the words, symbol, and image elements for directions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, since the credit is not part of a measure, the default-x and default-y attributes adjust the origin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relative to the bottom left-hand corner of the page. The enclosure for credit-words and credit-symbol is none","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCredit","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLCredit"}],"url":"\/documenta